#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:450
msgid "Added ``CLI.generator.className.test`` message."
msgstr "``CLI.generator.className.test`` 메시지가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:451
msgid "Added ``Validation.field_exists`` error message."
msgstr "``Validation.field_exists`` 오류 메시지가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:455
msgid "Changes"
msgstr "변경"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:457
msgid ""
"**Bootstrap:** The loading of **.env** and defining ``ENVIRONMENT`` have "
"been moved before loading of **bootstrap.php**."
msgstr ""
"**부트스트랩:** **.env** 로딩과 ``ENVIRONMENT`` 정의가 **bootstrap.php** 로딩 전으로 이동되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:460
msgid ""
"``Config\\Feature::$multipleFilters`` has been removed, because now :ref"
":`multiple-filters` are always enabled."
msgstr ""
"이제 :ref:`multiple-filters`\ 가 항상 활성화되어 있으므로 ``Config\\Feature::$multipleFilters``\ 가 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:462
msgid ""
"The default error level in the production environment "
"(**app/Config/Boot/production.php**) has been changed to ``E_ALL & "
"~E_DEPRECATED`` to match the default **php.ini** for production."
msgstr ""
"프로덕션 환경의 기본 오류 수준 (**app/Config/Boot/production.php**)이 "
"프로덕션용 기본 **php.ini**\ 에 맞게 ``E_ALL & ~E_DEPRECATED``\ 로 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:465
msgid ""
"**RouteCollection:** The HTTP method keys in the protected property "
"``$routes`` has been fixed from lowercase to uppercase."
msgstr "**RouteCollection:** 보호 속성 ``$routes``\ 의 HTTP 메서드 키가 소문자에서 대문자로 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:467
msgid ""
"**Exceptions:** Unused ``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\AlertError`` and "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\EmergencyError`` were removed."
msgstr ""
"**예외:** 사용되지 않는 ``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\AlertError``\ 와 "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\EmergencyError``\ 가 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:469
msgid ""
"**Forge:** ``SQLSRV`` Forge now converts ``ENUM`` data types to "
"``VARCHAR(n)`` when you add table columns. In previous version, it "
"converted to ``TEXT`` that is deprecated in SQL Server."
msgstr ""
"**Forge:** ``SQLSRV`` Forge가 이제 테이블 컬럼을 추가할 때 ``ENUM`` 데이터 타입을 ``VARCHAR(n)``\ 으로 변환합니다. "
"이전 버전에서는 SQL Server에서 사용 중단된 ``TEXT``\ 로 변환했습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:472
msgid "``declare(strict_types=1)`` has been added to most framework codebase."
msgstr "대부분의 프레임워크 코드베이스에 ``declare(strict_types=1)``\ 이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:476
