"``CodeIgniter\\Boot::loadEnvironmentBootstrap()`` 메서드로 이동되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:488
msgid ""
"The ``initializeKint()`` method has been deprecated. No longer used. It "
